<title>USA: MOTOR RACING-DAYTONA 500 RESULTS.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-DAYTONA 500 RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTONA BEACH, Fla 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of top 10 finishers in the Daytona 500 Winston Cup Series Race on Sunday, listing finish, starting position, driver, make of car, laps completed and prize money.</p>
<p>1. (6) Jeff Gordon, Chevrolet, 200, $377,410</p>
<p>2. (18) Terry Labonte, Chevrolet, 200, $194,925</p>
<p>3. (40) Ricky Craven, Chevrolet, 200, $155,625</p>
<p>4. (8) Bill Elliott, Ford, 200, $133,200</p>
<p>5. (9) Sterlin Marlin, Chevrolet, 200, $121,080</p>
<p>6. (21) Jeremy Mayfield, Ford, 200, $100,355</p>
<p>7. (11) Mark Martin, Ford, 200, $105,515</p>
<p>8. (17) Ward Burton, Pontiac, 200, $82,390</p>
<p>9. (13) Ricky Rudd, Ford, 200, $88,590</p>
<p>10.(22) Darrell Waltrip, Chevrolet 200, $78,840</p>
<p>Time of Race: 3:22:18; Average Speed: 148.295 MPH; Margin of Victory: Under caution; Caution Flags: 8 for 29 laps; Lead changes: 12 among 9 drivers.</p>
</text>
